 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;time limit per test: 0.25 sec.
memory limit per test: 4096 KB&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;input: standard
output: standard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are N integers (1&amp;lt;=N&amp;lt;=65537) A1, A2,.. AN (0&amp;lt;=Ai&amp;lt;=10^9). You need to find amount of such pairs (i, j) that 1&amp;lt;=iA[j].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Input&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first line of the input contains the number N. The second line contains N numbers A1&amp;hellip;AN.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>poj 2299 Ultra-QuickSort （树状数组＋离散化）</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2015/2015-08-04-poj2299/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2015 13:13:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</author><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2015/2015-08-04-poj2299/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;这道题可以总结的地方不少。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;１：对于一组乱序数列，每次只能交换相邻元素，达到有序交换的次数就是原数列中你逆序对的个数。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;　　cf上好像总喜欢出这个题。。。我印象中就出现三次了。。。。。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>hdu 4022 Bombing (离散化)</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2015/2015-08-01-hdu4022/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2015 02:12:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</author><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2015/2015-08-01-hdu4022/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;wa了两次，原因是在同一个点可能有多个基地。。。&lt;/p&gt;
